81587199864330_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YSKgMbKT3Z4Q7kNvwEqmWyH&_nc_oc=AdpzWKSDIqThTM1Qx-CPyMHxGBu7AKvUZtbwRkXzFNognv25ifSA9uYwzbOHjUzWjSM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFJAv1_67zLSELVIo7WZJifhJCz_irFEJ3cB_haPoCdEQ&oe=6A8EEDCA"}, {"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 3.png", "id": "1476300653694267", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1476300657027600_2840025129162091773_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JJpifo4OCOUQ7kNvwHj7LxL&_nc_oc=Ado231A7CyzQqrjbUgNtqTDFYVG6Y-T5nBZ5del2v4FghOYHv8pAVcXxUatHbF7BqBs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHGt2n5n7xDI5wscbWuzeh-evyf-Os1_bopIKXCCbfnvw&oe=6A8ED11A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "QuixPlayer", "keywords": ["360VideoPlayer", "180VideoPlayer"], "long_description": "**QuixPlayer - Control 180deg / 360deg Video Playback with QR Codes**\n\nQuixPlayer is a VR video player for Meta Quest 3 and 3S that enables simple, reliable, and fully offline synchronized video playback.\n\nUsing only a QR code, you can start video playback across multiple headsets at the same timing. No internet or local network is required, making it ideal for environments with restricted connectivity.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n**Offline Playback Control**\nScan a QR code to start video playback at a specified timing or condition. QuixPlayer operates entirely offline for stable performance.\n\n**Simple Operation**\nNo complex controller input is needed. Just scan a QR code and the experience begins.\n\n**Playback Modes**\nSYNC: Periodic time sync based on the headset clock (e.g. TRG:SYNC:5).\nREL: Relative countdown after scanning (e.g. TRG:REL:10).\nABS: Absolute time playback (e.g. TRG:ABS:110000).\n\n**QR Code Options**\nQR codes can specify video file name, video type (180deg or 360deg), and layout mode (None, SideBySide, OverUnder, SideBySide3D, OverUnder3D).\n\n**Flexible QR Code Format**\nTRG:{MODE}:{VALUE}?name={file_name}&type={360 or 180}&layout={layout}\n\n**Use Cases**\nSuitable for education, exhibitions, events, and other scenarios where synchronized playback is required without network access.\n\n**Experience**\nShare important moments with your audience at the exact same time using a QR-based playback system.\n", "short_description": "Easily sync and play 180\u00b0/360\u00b0 videos on Meta Quest by simply scanning a QR code."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 5.png", "id": "3862485207215612", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618264_3862485213882278_6983363211996585407_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uWzKvxSEbEEQ7kNvwH_zs86&_nc_oc=Adpy-9EYH7X_hd1jsdQ7mloztT7OiQeYRPoOhlnDniNcEobEcw7UUE8V9yg5AN9D29M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFucbZsbQZQb9imKrE8H3E5wSYHAegIS0ezpn9MA6Fl3g&oe=6A8EE42E"}, {"file_name": "432px \u2013 f \u2013 1.png", "id": "1135616805161792", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619148_1135616808495125_8615746792926765700_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YXNJT9EDsbIQ7kNvwG_5fRB&_nc_oc=Adoz1xbT1xCwOLTstgikVja-6LGwCAOgVlQFeYAax6Ba6dmTuwx-HNSA_EvCk8r7p68&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHu-tFA3OFP9LVgLozMYVPP36kXIgZc84tMZIZKP8kuQA&oe=6A8EF071"}, {"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 6.png", "id": "814564234364013", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_814564237697346_1085994346422534066_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HgZfKLoDNNQQ7kNvwFEyYhM&_nc_oc=AdrO6Lk7IfnPSGUIth8Ezu7i6EA3Oe4SBw00xvRGMBYBjJPSKVLB5q_3RMQZz9N1rgk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEaC-DlJZ4PWy_X0x2eu9SCT8Zr9_ovCu_X2xwGn7faPw&oe=6A8ECA33"}, {"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 2.png", "i